Package: incast.odin
Title: Use Odin2 Models with Incast Forecasts
Version: 0.0.1
Date: 2026-08-10
Authors@R: c(
    person("Cyril", "Geismar", , "cgeisma1@jh.edu", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Insight Net", role = c("cph", "fnd")))
Description: Connects compartmental transmission models written with 'odin2'
    to the 'fable' interface used by 'incast'. Models can therefore be fitted,
    cross-validated, ensembled and exported through the ordinary 'incast'
    workflow. Ready-to-use SIR and SEIR models are included.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
